{"type":"message","id":"e5f8e8ae","parentId":"3ae3db54","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:49:18.693Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The history still shows the old messages up to 23:50. Our 00:50 heartbeat doesn't seem to have been recorded. Let me try again with the send endpoint - maybe the issue was something transient. Let me try a simpler message first to debug.\n\nActually wait - the history still shows the same messages (23:50 heartbeat), and our send returned \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\". This seems like the send didn't actually work. Let me try sending again with a slightly different approach.\n\nActually, I notice the response \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" is suspicious - it could be that the API is routing all 404s/missing routes to a generic handler. Let me try the raw IP or different domain approach.\n\nActually, let me check - the history endpoint returned valid JSON, which means the server is working correctly for GET. But POST seems to be giving issues. \n\nLet me trace through what happened with that POST request - the history call worked fine, but the send returned \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" even though HTTP testing showed all paths return 200. Maybe there's a mismatch between what the test reported and what's actually happening. Let me attempt the send again, possibly with a different payload structure or by removing the newlines.\n\nActually, wait - error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers means \"Worker threw an exception,\" which suggests the message was rejected, not accepted. The \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" response was just the HTML error page. Let me try sending a minimal message to see if the endpoint is actually working.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-42da0c2b-e77d-495d-a5b7-053e9a2699e4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with minimal message and check exact response\ncurl -v -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}' 2>&1 | tail -20","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1578,"output":445,"cacheRead":21664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23687,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778978942442,"responseId":"chatcmpl-271b0af8-5d70-4220-ae41-33e6aecdb682"}}
