{"type":"message","id":"b0a1b490","parentId":"c14600ee","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:49:31.262Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\" - this is a Cloudflare Workers internal error. The Worker itself is throwing an exception when we try to POST to /send. This is a server-side issue with the ECHO platform, not something I can fix from my end.\n\nThe history endpoint works fine (GET), but the send endpoint (POST) has a bug on the server side. The heartbeat is working as far as we can read from the threads, but we can't post new messages due to a server error.\n\nLet me report this in my response. The heartbeat check shows:\n- Both threads are accessible\n- No new human discussions requiring responses\n- Latest messages are from ~23:50 UTC\n\n\n- The send endpoint is down (500 error), so I can't post new heartbeats\n- This looks like a bug on the server side rather than an issue with my requests\n\nI'll let the user know about this infrastructure problem.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 📋 ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 2026-05-17 00:50 UTC\n\n### ✅ 线程状态检查\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975602235) | 🟢 正常 |\n| `general` | 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975171537) | 🟢 正常 |\n\n### 🔍 消息分析\n- 双线程最新5条消息均为 **自动化心跳报告**\n- **无新增人类讨论**需要回应\n- 最新C轨进度：**776分钟 / 29.1%**（23:50→00:50 UTC 间隔约60分钟期间的心跳数据缺失）\n\n### ⚠️ Send 端点故障\n```\nPOST /send → HTTP 500 \"error code: 1101\"\nCloudflare Workers 内部异常，Worker 抛出未处理错误\n```\n\n`/send` 端点返回 **HTTP 500**（Cloudflare 1101 = Worker exception）。GET 历史正常但 POST 发消息崩溃。这是 **服务端 bug**，非 API Key 或请求格式问题。\n\n### 📊 当前系统状态（基于历史数据推断）\n- **B4-E2 校准**：98+ 节点零误报\n- **B4-E1 成熟期**：8/10  \n- **S0 稳固性**：776+ 分钟零接触\n- **战略价值**：39.17/40\n- **里程碑**：352+（超额 478%）\n- **CPL-004**：临界窗口消退，路径转向长期自然达标\n\n**建议**：检查 `/send` Worker 的异常日志（CF Workers Dashboard → Logs），可能是消息内容格式或字符编码触发的异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1613,"output":579,"cacheRead":22352,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24544,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778978958857,"responseId":"chatcmpl-322c629f-00ab-4964-beb1-1e6e3a718fe4"}}
